    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "file",
        "operation": "get",
        "owner": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $(\"Configuração Bootstrap\").first().json.owner }}",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "repository": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $(\"Configuração Bootstrap\").first().json.repository }}",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "filePath": "={{ \"projects/\" + $(\"Configuração Bootstrap\").first().json.projectSlug + \"/project.json\" }}",
        "asBinaryProperty": false,
        "additionalParameters": {
          "reference": "={{ $(\"Configuração Bootstrap\").first().json.branch }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "85c62e68-971c-42e0-ae89-99cbc112c8a4",
      "name": "Consultar projeto existente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.github",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        80
      ],
      "webhookId": "a0550118-6714-4496-89e6-6ce7e13f8abc",
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg=$('Configuração Bootstrap').first().json;\n  const exists=typeof $json.sha==='string';\n  if(exists&&!cfg.forceBootstrap){\n    throw new Error('Bootstrap já concluído para '+cfg.projectSlug+'. Use forceBootstrap somente com revisão explícita.');\n  }\n  return [{json:cfg}];"
      },
      "id": "6f3dbc1b-f042-4b77-bf2f-a9abc2edfe40",
      "name": "Validar primeira execução",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "SELECT_CORE_WORKFLOW_AFTER_IMPORT",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Core - Documentação n8n (Dry Run)"
        },
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": true
        }
      },
      "id": "49ef391e-83f5-4d12-99c4-bb47fee8ff61",
      "name": "Executar Core do projeto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        960,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg=$('Configuração Bootstrap').first().json;\n  const projects=$input.first().json.payloads??[];\n  const project=projects.find(item=>item.projectSlug===cfg.projectSlug);\n  if(!project) throw new Error('Core não retornou o projeto '+cfg.projectSlug);\n  return [{json:{...project,aiMode:cfg.aiMode,documentationMode:'bootstrap'}}];"
      },
      "id": "373c966a-4f36-4ce4-b3e3-5dc1860ee9ce",
      "name": "Selecionar projeto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "SELECT_AI_WORKFLOW_AFTER_IMPORT",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "AI - Enriquecimento da Documentação n8n"
        },
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": true
        }
      },
      "id": "2db668f5-40e3-4e66-80e6-78a3cb239b27",
      "name": "Executar enriquecimento inicial",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1584,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg=$('Configuração Bootstrap').first().json;\n  const input=$input.first().json;\n  const project=Array.isArray(input.payloads)?input.payloads[0]:input;\n  if(!project?.projectSlug) throw new Error('Projeto ausente na preparação do Bootstrap.');\n  const manifest=JSON.parse(project.technicalFiles?.['project.json']??'{}');\n  const today=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-CA',{timeZone:'America/Sao_Paulo',year:'numeric',month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit'})\n    .format(new Date()).replace(/-/g,'.');\n  const updatedManifest={\n    ...manifest,\n    bootstrapCompleted:true,\n    sourceOfTruth:'github',\n    aiMode:cfg.aiMode,\n    currentVersion:today+'.1',\n    bootstrapAt:new Date().toISOString(),\n    reviewRequired:true\n  };\n  const technicalFiles={...(project.technicalFiles??{})};\n  delete technicalFiles['project.json'];\n  const relativeFiles={\n    ...technicalFiles,\n    ...(project.humanFiles??{}),\n    'project.json':JSON.stringify(updatedManifest,null,2)\n  };\n  const files=Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(relativeFiles).map(([file,content])=>[\n    'projects/'+project.projectSlug+'/'+file,content\n  ]));\n  return [{json:{\n    owner:cfg.owner,\n    repository:cfg.repository,\n    branch:cfg.branch,\n    projectSlug:project.projectSlug,\n    files,\n    commitMessage:'docs('+project.projectSlug+'): bootstrap documentation'\n  }}];"
      },
      "id": "b09ffd55-1c18-496f-b98d-19b4a500a772",
      "name": "Preparar publicação inicial",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1920,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "SELECT_PUBLISHER_WORKFLOW_AFTER_IMPORT",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "Publisher - GitHub n8n-workflows"
        },
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": true
        }
      },
      "id": "bdccfdbd-2500-4f03-98ca-f9ff7e5329bf",
      "name": "Publicar Bootstrap",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        2160,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const publication=$input.first().json;\n  const cfg=$('Configuração Bootstrap').first().json;\n  return [{json:{\n    status:'bootstrap-complete',\n    projectSlug:cfg.projectSlug,\n    aiMode:cfg.aiMode,\n    repository:cfg.owner+'/'+cfg.repository,\n    branch:cfg.branch,\n    publication,\n    reviewRequired:true\n  }}];"
      },
      "id": "918d11b4-804e-4944-9208-2a1bc4b09eba",
      "name": "Resumo do Bootstrap",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2400,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Bootstrap — subworkflow de primeira publicação\n\n- Recebe projectSlug obrigatoriamente de outro workflow.\n- A entrada humana oficial é o workflow Bootstrap - Formulário.\n- Bloqueia reexecução quando project.json já existe.\n- Chama o Core determinístico e depois a IA obrigatoriamente.\n- Publica README.md, docs/architecture.mmd, workflows/ e project.json.\n- forceBootstrap permanece falso no formulário.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 680,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "9cda3638-71cb-459e-9023-9d5edf85b004",
      "name": "Documentação - Bootstrap",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -448
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Inputs e credenciais — Bootstrap\n\n### Edit Fields `Configuração Bootstrap`\n- `projectSlug` (livre e obrigatório): slug vindo do formulário.\n- `owner`, `repository`, `branch` (livres e obrigatórios): destino GitHub.\n- `forceBootstrap` (booleano controlado): mantenha `false`; `true` só para republicação deliberada.\n- `aiMode` (fixo): `bootstrap`. A IA é obrigatória nesta etapa.\n- `documentationMode` (fixo): `bootstrap`.\n\n### Credencial e dependências\n- `Consultar projeto existente`: credencial **GitHub API** com leitura do repositório/branch.\n- Selecione os subworkflows importados nos nodes: `Executar Core do projeto`, `Executar enriquecimento inicial` e `Publicar Bootstrap`.\n- A credencial OpenAI fica no subworkflow de IA; a credencial de escrita GitHub fica no Publisher.\n\n### Exemplo\n`projectSlug=carteira-invest`, `owner=acme`, `repository=n8n-workflows`, `branch=docs/generated`, `forceBootstrap=false`.\n\nGuia completo: `docs/inputs/bootstrap.md`",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 880,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "d405fbe4-c354-4bb7-9a50-9f91001e93be",
      "name": "Configuração e credenciais - Bootstrap",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        -688
      ]
    }
